 5. Replace full index rebuild with incremental indexing
     - Track processed NDJSON segments / offsets.
     - Read only newly appended events.
     - Update tag_index.json and related indexes incrementally.

 6. Decouple indexing from ingest
     - Remove synchronous spawning of indexer.ts from ingest.
     - Add an events/ filesystem watcher.
     - Trigger indexing when new event files or segments appear.

 7. Introduce pluggable index backend
     - Define an index backend interface.
     - Keep current JSON backend as default.
     - Leave room for SQLite/bbolt/roaring bitmap implementations later.

