 11. Add Git scaling optimizations
 - Support partial clone with --filter=blob:none.
 - Add sparse checkout instructions/scripts.
 - Add scheduled git gc.

 12. Add background Git batch writer
 - Batch file additions and commits when async mode is introduced.
 - Ensure the synchronous archival path remains available for durability.

